  "configuration_id": "config_002",
  "reason": "Existing evidence: RNA-only PCA singleprofile is much stronger than image-only ResNet singleprofile in both accuracy and F1, but it is still unclear whether using multiple profiles with simple aggregation improves the RNA representation. config_002 tests this by keeping the same PCA RNA encoder and adding multiprofile with avgpool, isolating the profile/aggregation effect without introducing a new encoder or fusion. It is the best next budget use because it exploits the currently strongest direction, may improve validation accuracy, and will determine whether multiprofile RNA is worth extending to more complex aggregations or multimodal fusion."
}

